                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8a425556-002e-32a7-bcb5-3d1cf6be90c2",
                        "entry_id": "74686f63-18b2-32ba-8d50-b1bd5881e18d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор. дорожная, обычно крытая, повозка на уменьшающих тряску длинных продольных брусьях (дрогах), которыми соединены передок с задком"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "796844c5-bcba-4677-916c-2a01aedbfa1b",
                                "sense_id": "8a425556-002e-32a7-bcb5-3d1cf6be90c2",
                                "text": "Показался тарантас, запряженный тройкой ямских лошадей; в тарантасе мелькнул околыш студентской фуражки, знакомый очерк дорогого лица…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "10fe1411-d7b1-4e81-bc23-2bce60480930",
                                "sense_id": "8a425556-002e-32a7-bcb5-3d1cf6be90c2",
                                "text": "На дворе стоял тарантас, выпрягали лошадей, ходили с фонарем, суетились."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a1c97177-0a85-3e93-b655-143a22c0cb6f",
                        "entry_id": "74686f63-18b2-32ba-8d50-b1bd5881e18d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. старый, испорченный автомобиль"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc2dc072-02cb-4e82-ba02-f8cd5963f3a5",
                                "sense_id": "a1c97177-0a85-3e93-b655-143a22c0cb6f",
                                "text": "Тарантас паралитично трясся, выстреливая из глушителя снопы искр."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e2ce8a54-9907-4296-8aa5-1f9c831235f1",
                        "source_entry_id": "74686f63-18b2-32ba-8d50-b1bd5881e18d",
                        "source_sense_description": "повозка",
                        "target_lang_word": "tarantass",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tarantass",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0397021b-9e42-3dce-a463-5f48907261ca",
                                        "entry_id": "8d60f0a0-1594-3ab7-9e18-cd844ae6247c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A low horse-drawn carriage without springs used in Russia, capable of having its wheels replaced with runners during the winter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dffa9dce-6df7-45ce-9fd5-9a3135d6ad27",
                                                "sense_id": "0397021b-9e42-3dce-a463-5f48907261ca",
                                                "text": "Three kinds of conveyances are available: the telega, or cart without springs, which has to be changed at every station, and for which a charge of about 8d. is made at every stage; the kibitka, or cart (in winter a sledge) with a hood; and the tarantas, a kind of carriage on wooden springs, which admits of the traveller lying down full length, and which can be made very comfortable at night."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35af6f9d-7163-49d9-8b0a-63d0f1d1aa8a",
                                                "sense_id": "0397021b-9e42-3dce-a463-5f48907261ca",
                                                "text": "From Samarkand, using that peculiarly Russian means of transport, the springless, horse-drawn tarantass, Curzon reached Tashkent by the post road in thirty uncomfortable hours."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "646204fc-64e3-428a-a55f-f6ccb4de279e",
                        "source_entry_id": "74686f63-18b2-32ba-8d50-b1bd5881e18d",
                        "source_sense_description": "повозка",
                        "target_lang_word": "calesa",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "calesa",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f713dd1-b2b3-3a5b-9638-484ef27ca0d9",
                                        "entry_id": "3d33ef42-acd2-3088-854e-e1a54362f3b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Carruaje de dos o cuatro ruedas impulsado por caballos, suele ser descubierto donde se sienta el conductor. Los asientos para pasajeros, de dos o cuatro puestos, pueden estar cubiertos o a la intemperie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
